  "assertions": [
    "Wrong general/balance ClientAddressWire bytes yield named Receive evidence only after existing earlier conditions succeed; empty/short/long payloads keep the same byte comparison.",
    "Unique root counterparts, correct family/sequence/action, unit/money presence, valid Service-Identifier/Timezone, SMS node/forbidden fields and client/MMS presence are verified with shared source budgets.",
    "Owned quotes are36+align4(payload length) bytes: two minimal vendor group headers and the entire original client AVP including padding; no sibling, subscriber or financial payloads are copied.",
    "ErrUnsupported remains; Receive adds ErrField and full vendor10415 path873/2000/2018. Build/Send retain their previous vendor2018 error.",
    "Earlier sequence/subscription/action/unit/SMS/parameter/presence conditions and structural group errors retain priority; later MMS exclusion rules are not pulled forward.",
    "MMS/StandardMoney payloads stay opaque to this trusted callback; the main decoder still validates complete requests. Client bytes are not reinterpreted as Address.",
    "TCP/TLS ordinary/emergency/default paths verify exact reply budgets, envelopes, non-delivery, held charges, ownership, follow-up and retirement; a separate short emergency reply budget proves closure without truncation.",
    "Local affected-target fuzz and complete hosted17-target receipts are separately counted.",
    "Pure Go, application-owned persistence, frozen rc.1 receipts, module requirements and immutable tags remain unchanged."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Other existing conditional/value rules (including request relations and remaining MMS constraints), mixed values/omissions and unreviewed group/cardinality/domain/handshake/header mappings remain separate. Earlier mixed presence or numeric failures retain their existing classification; safe close remains when no reviewed diagnostic applies.",
    "The changed development checkout needs a future immutable version and fresh core/adapter/cold-install acceptance. The verified rc.1 receipt remains valid only for its frozen commits.",
    "External private-template/target-recovery/role evidence and declared long-soak/saturation/tenant/mixed-transport acceptance remain separate."
  ],
